    "Dinky": {
      "formatVersion": 2,
      "name": "Dinky",
      "notes": "A fighter. It cannot hope to destroy anything much larger than itself, so it puts engines above the guns everything else shoots at first: a capital it strands is a capital out of the battle, which is the most a craft this size can do to one.",
